<item>
 <title>Desarrollo de Redes Sociales Corporativas con Drupal (#Red)</title>
 <link>http://2012.drupalcamp.es/en/node/84</link>
 <description>  &lt;span class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;
    Audiencia:
  &lt;/span&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;field-session-audience inline&quot;&gt;

      &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&quot;/en/audience/clients&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot;&gt;Clients&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&quot;/en/audience/designers&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot;&gt;Designers&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/li&gt;
